{"path":"container/stack/stack","title":"std::stack<T,Container>::stack","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::stack&lt;T,Container&gt;::</span>stack","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/stack/stack","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Constructs new underlying container of the container adaptor from a variety of data sources.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">stack<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> stack<span class=\"br0\">(</span>Container<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<tbody class=\"t-dcl-rev t-dcl-rev-num\"><tr class=\"t-dcl-rev-aux\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td></td>\n<td rowspan=\"142\">(2)</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-until-cxx11\">\n<td><div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">explicit</span> stack<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> Container<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> cont <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> Container<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> </td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx11\">(until C++11)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">explicit</span> stack<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> Container<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> cont <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</s